The `dc_serialize` and `dc_deserialize` functions allow serialization and deserialization of the collection to and from a file, maintaining the integrity of the timestamp field during the process. The code also initializes the random number generator with the current time to ensure that the values generated are consistent across multiple runs for reproducibility.']

