The list can handle dynamic sizes, and the function is optimized for memory usage and performance considering the low-latency network interface requirement. Error handling is implemented to manage cases where RNTI collisions occur during population. The function should integrate seamlessly with an existing signal processing framework as it follows a standard C programming style.']

